<a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sins_of_Attrition\" title=\"Sins of Attrition\">Sins of Attrition</a></b>, Any chest&#160;; <a href=\"/page/Tower_of_Despair\" title=\"Tower of Despair\">Tower of Despair</a>, <a href=\"/page/Nythirios\" title=\"Nythirios\">Nythirios</a> chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\"> Constitution +6</a></b>: This item gives the wearer improved health, granting a +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to Constitution.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Heightened_Awareness\" title=\"Heightened Awareness\">Heightened Awareness 1</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Heightened_Awareness\" title=\"Heightened Awareness\">Heightened Awareness 1</a>:</b> This item helps you to quickly read situations with sharpness and clarity, allowing you to predict actions before they occur. You gain a +1 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to AC.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight_of_the_Chalice\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight of the Chalice</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Knight_of_the_Chalice\" title=\"Named item sets\">Knight of the Chalice</a>:</b> <a href=\"/page/Spell_Resistance\" title=\"Spell Resistance\">Spell Resistance</a> (22).  If have Knight of the Chalice III Enhancement: additional damage with weapons versus Evil Outsiders.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Lorinthor%27s_Belt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Lorinthor%27s_Belt.png/420px-Lorinthor%27s_Belt.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"388\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Lorinthor%27s_Belt.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Belts of this type were worn by members of the Knights of the Chalice. The markings on this item indicate that it was worn by Lorinthor, a dedicated Knight and hero to the people of Xen'drik.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>The other part of the <a href=\"/page/Unique_item_sets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unique item sets\">Knight of the Chalice</a> item set is <a href=\"/page/Lorinthor%27s_Ring\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lorinthor&#39;s Ring\">Lorinthor's Ring</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817221845\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.113 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3005/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20415/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6003/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n143.79%  137.239     40 Template:IO\n100.00%   95.446      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   95.446      1 -total\n 97.05%   92.627      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 47.82%   45.639      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 46.91%   44.775      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 45.94%   43.851      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 45.00%   42.950      2 Template:InCategory\n 23.94%   22.849      5 Template:Popup\n 18.62%   17.769      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:11368-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817221845 and revision id 633291. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
